 "<b style=\"font-size:25px;color:#2f8f83\">Idea</b><br><span style=\"font-size:20px;color:#2b2a1c\">Un pequeño test antes y después hace visible el progreso.</span>": "<b style=\"font-size:25px;color:#2f8f83\">Idea</b><br><span style=\"font-size:20px;color:#2b2a1c\">A short quiz before and after makes progress visible.</span>",
